  safe_refusal. The supervisor classifies scope BEFORE any worker runs:
  no retrieval, no LLM call, ~0.12s instead of ~10s, and $0.00.

  Expect: scope=out_of_scope, verified=false, refusal_reason set, 0 citations.
  This is the Week 1 "Verified - 0 sources" defect, fixed.
